#: command.cc:125
msgid ""
"The server rejected both EHLO and HELO commands as unknown or unimplemented.\n"
"Please contact the server's system administrator."
msgstr ""

#: command.cc:139
msgid ""
"Unexpected server response to %1 command.\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""

#: command.cc:159
msgid ""
"Your SMTP server does not support TLS. Disable TLS, if you want to connect "
"without encryption."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີຟໄເວີ์ SMTP ບໍ່ສະຫນັບສະຫນູນ TLS ທ່ານອາດປິດການໃຊ້ງານ TLS "
"ໄດ້ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#: command.cc:173
msgid ""
"Your SMTP server claims to support TLS, but negotiation was unsuccessful.\n"
"You can disable TLS in KDE using the crypto settings module."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີຟເວີ SMTP ຕ້ອງການການສະຫນັບສະຫນູນ TLS ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດທຳໄດ້ສຳເລັດ\n"
"ທ່ານສາມາດປິດກາຍໃຊ້ງານ TLS ໃນ KDE ໄດ້ ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂມດູນຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#: command.cc:178
msgid "Connection Failed"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

